## The Ford Road, Running

::bg{location="ford_road" time="night"}
::music{action="change" mood="sad" volume="normal"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: The Duskbound do not chase you far. They do not need to. {{occasion.payload.wagonsLost:plural(A wagon burns|#Word wagons burn)}} on the near arch, and the mules scatter into the dark with the Company's cargo on their backs.
::set{run.wagons -= occasion.payload.wagonsLost}
@narrator{code="0020" when="holds('fell', ['maelis'])"}: Maelis fell on the chain, and it made no difference at all. Her people held the bridge without her.
@corvin{code="0010" when="holds('inParty', ['corvin'])"}: I would like it noted that I had a plan that did not involve this.
@isolde{code="0010" when="holds('inParty', ['isolde'])"}: Get the wounded on the last wagon. Warden. Warden. Look at me. We are leaving.
